  "description": "On-device AI core for Circle. 1.4.0 ships the P0 atomic shift — catalog-driven, device-inferred SDK. New: ModelScopeCatalogClient (live ModelScope catalog with disk cache, OnStartup/Daily/Manual/Never cadence, connectivity gate skips HTTPS when host reports offline), ICatalogSignatureVerifier (fail-closed NullCatalogSignatureVerifier default), DeviceProbe + DefaultDeviceContext (moved into Core — RAM/storage/CPU/GPU/thermal/connectivity snapshot with Wearable/Phone/Tablet/Desktop/Workstation tier classification), DeviceTierDefaults (ContextWindow 2K-131K, MaxConcurrency 1-min(16,cores-2), AgenticMaxIterations 2-10 per tier). ModelRegistryService primes from catalog client when supplied; AllModels is now virtual. ModelEntry adds MinRamGb, MinStorageGb, Capabilities[], QualityRank for device-fit ranking.",
